0196: the rear IMX363 through the same capture (bluecam=1 bluecam_stream=3)

The receiver path takes the CSIPHY as a parameter: CSIPHY0 for the rear
(stock dtbo csiphy-sd-index 0; camcc csiphy0 0x5020, csi0phytimer RCG
0x5004 / branch 0x501c), CSIPHY2 for the front. IMX363 settings from the
sdm670-mainline imx363.c (24 MHz, 4032x3024), retimed for the 19.2 MHz
MCLK (pre-divider 2, VT x131, OP x139) and 2x2-binned to 2016x1512 (3.8
MB in a 4 MiB buffer). Analog gain bluecam_rear_gain (code, 384 = 4x).
The rear saves only the colour snap (1008x756).

